    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLEASE NOTE THE CURRENT ISSUES BELOW! We're encountering some unexpected bugs, thank you for your patience! We'll be sending periodic patches over the next two weeks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Office Type is an office-themed comedy dating simulator with a wide variety of characters to learn about and narratives to explore. Take each character on dates around the city, learn their interests, answer questions, and gain their affection through match-three puzzle gameplay. Try the  demo and buy the full game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Known Issues List:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Issues will be removed from this list as patches are available. Save often and check for updates regularly!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three characters\u2019 storylines currently have some placeholder dates while we work out pipeline issues: Antonella (Date 23 onward), Toni (Date 11 onward), and Beatrice (Date 9 onward). Please avoid these characters for now, we\u2019re sorry for the inconvenience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some characters are missing pose, expression, and voice assignments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hura\u2019s hijab is sometimes used during minigame moments where it doesn\u2019t match the rest of the date.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Load button sometimes requires additional clicks to activate. This may also require you to load a different file first.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suspected issue in Mahab\u2019s story. Please report any problems encountered.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Add Love to your R\u00e9sum\u00e9!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select eight people into your office dating roster from a cast of 24 unique characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on more than one character at a time, pursuing friendships, relationships, or something more casual.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your relationships through deep storylines with multiple-choice decisions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Impress your date with big combos in our match-3+ sticky note puzzle gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore dozens of locations around the city while on your breaks from CompCorp!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408090/extras/7720aa269f3f8ec108a6547d90dd392e.avif?t=1754369901\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408090/extras/eee6786055be986bfd5421f540b29400.avif?t=1754369901\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLEASE NOTE THE CURRENT ISSUES BELOW! We're encountering some unexpected bugs, thank you for your patience! We'll be sending periodic patches over the next two weeks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Office Type is an office-themed comedy dating simulator with a wide variety of characters to learn about and narratives to explore. Take each character on dates around the city, learn their interests, answer questions, and gain their affection through match-three puzzle gameplay. Try the  demo and buy the full game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Known Issues List:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Issues will be removed from this list as patches are available. Save often and check for updates regularly!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three characters\u2019 storylines currently have some placeholder dates while we work out pipeline issues: Antonella (Date 23 onward), Toni (Date 11 onward), and Beatrice (Date 9 onward). Please avoid these characters for now, we\u2019re sorry for the inconvenience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some characters are missing pose, expression, and voice assignments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hura\u2019s hijab is sometimes used during minigame moments where it doesn\u2019t match the rest of the date.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Load button sometimes requires additional clicks to activate. This may also require you to load a different file first.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suspected issue in Mahab\u2019s story. Please report any problems encountered.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Add Love to your R\u00e9sum\u00e9!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select eight people into your office dating roster from a cast of 24 unique characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on more than one character at a time, pursuing friendships, relationships, or something more casual.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your relationships through deep storylines with multiple-choice decisions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Impress your date with big combos in our match-3+ sticky note puzzle gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore dozens of locations around the city while on your breaks from CompCorp!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408090/extras/7720aa269f3f8ec108a6547d90dd392e.avif?t=1754369901\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408090/extras/eee6786055be986bfd5421f540b29400.avif?t=1754369901\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
